Add or remove a daemon profile

Usage:
  mcp-runtime adapter service profile [command]

Available Commands:
  add           Add a profile and print its local MCP URL once
  client-config Write an MCP client configuration with this profile's local credential
  remove        Remove a profile

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for profile

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime adapter service profile [command] --help" for more information about a command.
